# Painting Estimate Pro currently uses no environment variables.
#
# The app is fully static (Astro) plus client-side React islands that
# persist to the browser's own IndexedDB — there is no server, no database
# connection string, and no API key anywhere in the codebase (verified:
# `grep -rn "import.meta.env\|process.env" src/ astro.config.mjs` returns
# nothing).
#
# When a payment provider is selected (see docs/ACCESS_SPEC.md), its
# publishable/public key and webhook signing secret will need real
# environment variables at that point — this file exists as the place to
# document them once that decision is made, not as a placeholder for
# something that already exists.
